            {"category": "overview", "q": "What does `backend/routers/forge.py` do?", "a": "Forge MVP (Beta V1.3 Theme 3) — detection engineering inside the intel pane. Endpoints: - GET /api/forge/coverage — MITRE coverage map: stack profile × techniques × rule status (community / yours / gap) - GET /api/hunt-packs/{technique_id} — hunt pack content for one technique (saved packs, template baseline, linked CVEs) - POST /api/hunt-packs/generate — generate + persist a CVE→pack link Everything is local and deterministic: hunt-pack generate"},
