            {"category": "overview", "q": "What does `backend/webhooks/ssrf.py` do?", "a": "SSRF protections for outbound webhook HTTP (V1.4 Theme 2). Validates destination hostnames/IPs before connect, pins resolved IPs on the wire (Host header preserved), allows https only, disables redirects, and never attaches internal API secrets to outbound headers."},
